1
00:00:00,630 --> 00:00:04,900
Get in a good mood with Mukai
during the fireworks.

2
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:07,450
It will be your chance to
get ahead of Minase.

3
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:11,740
There are lots of stalls.

4
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:15,060
The fireworks here are
beautiful and famous, after all.

5
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:16,950
I'm really looking forward to it.

6
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:19,580
Huh?

7
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,540
Geez... Where is Naoya?

8
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:25,050
If we split up,
maybe we'll find him on time.

9
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:26,130
Okay!

10
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:26,760
Also...

11
00:00:32,170 --> 00:00:35,020
I have a proposal.

12
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,712
Saki!

13
00:00:44,714 --> 00:00:46,941
Minase!

14
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:51,200
I have to find them quick.

15
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,160
We promised to watch fireworks together...

16
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:58,080
My chance to make memories with them...

17
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:06,050
Minase!

18
00:01:07,390 --> 00:01:09,260
Naoya!

19
00:01:10,020 --> 00:01:13,220
Naoya!

20
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:16,180
Minase!

21
00:01:18,050 --> 00:01:21,850
Huh? Mukai and Minase?

22
00:01:29,130 --> 00:01:33,610
She is Saki's friend.

23
00:01:33,610 --> 00:01:38,990
We can't let someone from the class
find out about our relationship.

24
00:01:38,994 --> 00:01:41,956
Are you ready to fall in
fall in love with me?

25
00:01:41,956 --> 00:01:46,127
I wanna let you know when
I have a crush on you! You!

26
00:01:48,087 --> 00:01:51,048
A throbbing development
is a maiden's desire!

27
00:01:51,048 --> 00:01:52,299
Is admiration not enough?

28
00:01:52,299 --> 00:01:54,093
It is not exciting enough!

29
00:01:54,093 --> 00:01:56,971
A beam of love that heals the world

30
00:01:56,971 --> 00:01:59,932
I want to be loved, I want to be in love

31
00:01:59,932 --> 00:02:01,350
Such ambiguous impulse

32
00:02:01,350 --> 00:02:02,685
I miss you! How about you?

33
00:02:02,685 --> 00:02:05,229
Notice my gaze

34
00:02:05,980 --> 00:02:08,899
I see the future where I am with you

35
00:02:08,899 --> 00:02:10,901
My dream is getting bigger

36
00:02:10,901 --> 00:02:14,196
The feelings I have been hiding
just popped out

37
00:02:14,196 --> 00:02:17,408
This heart of mine becomes noisy
when it is just the two of us

38
00:02:17,408 --> 00:02:22,830
Although you won't notice
since you are so dense

39
00:02:22,830 --> 00:02:29,044
I know that I am not the one
you are looking at

40
00:02:29,044 --> 00:02:32,256
Still, I cannot stop wishing for

41
00:02:32,256 --> 00:02:35,843
a love story with you

42
00:02:36,468 --> 00:02:39,680
I want to fall in love dramatically

43
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:42,558
I want to love you romantically

44
00:02:42,558 --> 00:02:48,480
I want you to take me for real
and fall in love with you

45
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:51,525
Choose me in a roundabout way

46
00:02:51,525 --> 00:02:54,653
Make me laugh with a happy ending

47
00:02:54,653 --> 00:02:57,656
There is a view I want to see with you

48
00:02:57,656 --> 00:03:00,451
I would rather be next to you

49
00:03:00,451 --> 00:03:02,328
Just keep that in mind

50
00:03:13,250 --> 00:03:16,720
Mukai and Minase, right?

51
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:21,890
Nice!
I found Pokomon cotton candy!

52
00:03:21,890 --> 00:03:24,010
One of these, please!

53
00:03:25,290 --> 00:03:26,730
Cute!

54
00:03:27,030 --> 00:03:28,670
So embarrassing.

55
00:03:29,580 --> 00:03:34,110
I'm going to eat this
in the park over there.

56
00:03:34,110 --> 00:03:37,320
I forgot I have something to do.

57
00:03:45,180 --> 00:03:49,640
Now that I think about it,
people from our school would come here.

58
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:52,170
Yeah, you're right.

59
00:03:58,450 --> 00:04:01,230
We can't keep dilly-dallying or
the fireworks will be over!

60
00:04:01,230 --> 00:04:03,060
Right! We still have to find Saki.

61
00:04:03,060 --> 00:04:05,780
We've already arranged to meet up here.

62
00:04:05,780 --> 00:04:07,140
So rest easy.

63
00:04:07,140 --> 00:04:09,350
Oh? Is that so?

64
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:14,440
Also, we promised each other...

65
00:04:16,850 --> 00:04:19,517
Whoever meets you first...

66
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:23,701
will be able to spend time
alone with you.

67
00:04:26,140 --> 00:04:30,502
I want to watch the fireworks together...

68
00:04:30,504 --> 00:04:37,631
and make summer festival
memories with you.

69
00:04:44,900 --> 00:04:48,110
It's pretty dark here.

70
00:04:48,110 --> 00:04:51,020
So, we don't have to worry
about being seen.

71
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,290
Minase...

72
00:04:54,980 --> 00:04:57,690
Okay! Let's watch the fireworks
with all of our might!

73
00:04:58,460 --> 00:05:00,400
I'm so glad!

74
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,405
So delicious!

75
00:05:01,410 --> 00:05:05,367
(Completely forgot about Naoya)

76
00:05:09,670 --> 00:05:12,290
Okay, then...

77
00:05:12,290 --> 00:05:13,750
Excuse me!

78
00:05:21,990 --> 00:05:24,800
Minase is being proactive.

79
00:05:28,790 --> 00:05:31,770
The fireworks are so pretty.

80
00:05:32,380 --> 00:05:34,980
She's trying so hard.

81
00:05:35,310 --> 00:05:37,690
I want to answer her feelings!

82
00:05:39,030 --> 00:05:42,490
Na... Naoya?!

83
00:05:47,450 --> 00:05:51,410
If you're going to be like that...

84
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:55,250
In that case...

85
00:05:55,250 --> 00:05:56,506
How about this?!

86
00:05:57,210 --> 00:05:58,550
Got you!

87
00:06:06,470 --> 00:06:08,500
We're not watching the fireworks at all.

88
00:06:08,500 --> 00:06:10,180
You're right.

89
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:26,450
Being together with you like this...

90
00:06:27,900 --> 00:06:29,800
really makes me happy.

91
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:34,050
Minase...

92
00:06:41,950 --> 00:06:43,550
About earlier...

93
00:06:44,450 --> 00:06:49,690
For having to hide our relationship
from people around us.

94
00:06:49,690 --> 00:06:50,650
I'm really sorry!

95
00:06:50,650 --> 00:06:51,310
Huh?

96
00:06:51,690 --> 00:06:54,100
It's fine.

97
00:06:54,640 --> 00:06:58,420
The happiness from dating you is bigger

98
00:06:58,420 --> 00:07:02,230
than the sadness because
we have to hide it from others.

99
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:08,200
But still, this has to be hard on you.

100
00:07:13,580 --> 00:07:16,560
Our relationship is indeed complicated.

101
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:20,550
We'll probably have to face
a lot of problems in the future.

102
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:33,660
But even so...

103
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:40,510
If I get to stay together with you
for the next year or even further,

104
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:45,700
and if you keep looking my way,

105
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:48,820
I think it's all worth it.

106
00:07:54,850 --> 00:08:00,960
Of course, it's not like I never think
about wanting to monopolize you.

107
00:08:07,030 --> 00:08:12,680
But the Naoya I fell in love with
is the Naoya who's in love with Saki.

108
00:08:16,630 --> 00:08:18,370
Minase...

109
00:08:24,700 --> 00:08:26,240
Naoya!

110
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:28,200
Nagisa!

111
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:29,530
Saki.

112
00:08:29,850 --> 00:08:31,620
Then, I'll take my leave.

113
00:08:31,620 --> 00:08:33,370
We promised to take turns.

114
00:08:35,460 --> 00:08:41,420
The stuff we did when we were alone was
embarrassing, so please keep it secret.

115
00:08:42,630 --> 00:08:44,490
Well, then.

116
00:08:47,190 --> 00:08:48,270
Naoya?

117
00:08:48,900 --> 00:08:51,300
What did you and Nagisa do together?

118
00:08:51,300 --> 00:08:54,010
About that...

119
00:08:54,550 --> 00:08:55,600
I can't tell you!

120
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,430
That's suspicious!

121
00:08:57,850 --> 00:09:02,470
A lot of progress with Naoya in one go.

122
00:09:07,340 --> 00:09:11,360
Are you really not going to tell me
what you did with Nagisa?

123
00:09:11,690 --> 00:09:13,570
It was embarrassing for her, so...

124
00:09:13,570 --> 00:09:15,830
You did something embarrassing with her?!

125
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:17,240
I can't tell you.

126
00:09:20,220 --> 00:09:22,210
More importantly, Saki...

127
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:24,366
Let's change gears now!

128
00:09:24,370 --> 00:09:26,540
Watch the fireworks,
get in a good mood,

129
00:09:26,540 --> 00:09:28,710
and then let's kiss to create
our happy memories!

130
00:09:28,710 --> 00:09:31,170
As if I could have that mood right now!

131
00:09:31,990 --> 00:09:34,140
I feel really uneasy, you know!

132
00:09:37,810 --> 00:09:41,350
But the fireworks will be over soon.

133
00:09:43,100 --> 00:09:46,780
We couldn't create a good mood
and get to kiss back then!

134
00:09:47,580 --> 00:09:48,900
If we let this chance go by,

135
00:09:48,900 --> 00:09:51,190
I have a feeling that
we'll keep doing it again!

136
00:09:53,390 --> 00:09:56,780
And this could go on forever...

137
00:09:57,220 --> 00:10:00,130
I don't want to make you wait any longer!

138
00:10:03,500 --> 00:10:06,000
Or do you not want to kiss me anymore?

139
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,170
Of course I do!

140
00:10:07,170 --> 00:10:08,880
Wait, don't make me say it!

141
00:10:14,430 --> 00:10:15,470
Saki...

142
00:10:15,970 --> 00:10:17,320
Fine.

143
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:22,890
I don't care what you and Nagisa did,
I just have to do what I have to do.

144
00:10:25,140 --> 00:10:28,440
Let's watch the fireworks
and get in a good mood!

145
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:30,430
Alright! Let's do it!

146
00:10:39,620 --> 00:10:41,950
I need to calm down.

147
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:51,610
Your body has Nagisa's scent all over it!

148
00:10:51,610 --> 00:10:52,340
Huh?

149
00:10:52,340 --> 00:10:54,610
Wait, not just her...

150
00:10:55,180 --> 00:10:57,670
Shino's and Mirika's too!

151
00:10:57,670 --> 00:11:00,680
Also the scent of
a girl I don't even know!

152
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:02,270
How are you even able to tell?

153
00:11:02,270 --> 00:11:05,570
Huh? Of course I recognize
the scent of beautiful girls.

154
00:11:05,570 --> 00:11:06,730
Is that so?

155
00:11:07,730 --> 00:11:08,940
Well?

156
00:11:09,460 --> 00:11:13,103
While we were separated...

157
00:11:13,105 --> 00:11:17,911
what did you do
with so many girls?

158
00:11:18,700 --> 00:11:20,620
I didn't do anything indecent.

159
00:11:24,670 --> 00:11:27,010
Things happened and
I had my body stick close to them.

160
00:11:27,010 --> 00:11:28,580
That sounds really indecent!

161
00:11:28,950 --> 00:11:30,650
Really, nothing happened!

162
00:11:30,650 --> 00:11:31,920
Let's just watch the fireworks!

163
00:11:35,510 --> 00:11:40,010
Well, you never lie.

164
00:11:41,730 --> 00:11:43,390
Yeah, you can't.

165
00:11:46,650 --> 00:11:51,520
This is our first summer fireworks
since we started dating.

166
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:54,000
It'd be a waste not to enjoy it.

167
00:11:57,890 --> 00:12:03,110
We spent a lot of summers together
ever since we were a kid.

168
00:12:04,930 --> 00:12:10,890
Unlike back then, we're lovers now.

169
00:12:14,650 --> 00:12:16,260
And...

170
00:12:20,180 --> 00:12:22,560
We've become adults.

171
00:12:25,180 --> 00:12:27,210
And...

172
00:12:32,150 --> 00:12:33,400
(Nagisa's scent)

173
00:12:33,850 --> 00:12:36,140
I'm being two-timed on.

174
00:12:36,740 --> 00:12:39,450
Isn't this too sad?!

175
00:12:40,380 --> 00:12:43,010
I can't focus at all!

176
00:12:43,010 --> 00:12:45,540
This is why two-timing is such a bother!

177
00:12:45,540 --> 00:12:48,410
Just calm down and watch the fireworks!

178
00:12:48,410 --> 00:12:50,920
- Don't say it like that!
- And with that,

179
00:12:50,920 --> 00:12:54,460
today's fireworks festival is over.

180
00:12:54,460 --> 00:12:55,290
What?

181
00:12:55,290 --> 00:12:56,380
Huh?

182
00:13:01,650 --> 00:13:03,520
Emergency treatment complete.

183
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:17,230
My moment at the fireworks festival
with Naoya...

184
00:13:18,730 --> 00:13:19,800
is over?

185
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:22,360
Just wait over there!

186
00:13:30,690 --> 00:13:33,420
I bought some fireworks.

187
00:13:38,650 --> 00:13:42,220
Should I not have?

188
00:13:43,550 --> 00:13:49,170
Since the big fireworks launch is over,
you bought smaller ones.

189
00:13:49,870 --> 00:13:52,210
That's just so cliché.

190
00:13:52,210 --> 00:13:55,370
Well, I can't deny that.

191
00:13:58,930 --> 00:14:00,610
Oh, well...

192
00:14:00,950 --> 00:14:03,400
It's not bad at all.
Let's do it!

193
00:14:04,710 --> 00:14:06,530
Saki.

194
00:14:07,570 --> 00:14:09,950
Which one should I pick?

195
00:14:13,630 --> 00:14:17,540
Even though I keep causing trouble
by two-timing you,

196
00:14:17,540 --> 00:14:20,810
thank you for still accepting me.

197
00:14:20,810 --> 00:14:22,550
What's this, all of a sudden?

198
00:14:22,990 --> 00:14:25,800
If you weren't the one
I was going out with,

199
00:14:26,540 --> 00:14:29,690
I'm sure this would've been over
from the start.

200
00:14:32,410 --> 00:14:33,800
Naoya...

201
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:37,310
But that's exactly why...

202
00:14:37,890 --> 00:14:42,070
As soon as you two started dating,
a different girl suddenly showed up,

203
00:14:42,780 --> 00:14:46,440
and even got the first kiss.

204
00:14:47,290 --> 00:14:51,080
There's no way
she's really okay with that.

205
00:14:51,520 --> 00:14:56,540
I want to know how you feel right now.

206
00:14:59,590 --> 00:15:02,510
How I feel?

207
00:15:03,170 --> 00:15:06,580
We started living together with Minase,

208
00:15:06,580 --> 00:15:08,850
a lot has happened with Mirika,

209
00:15:08,850 --> 00:15:10,830
and got found out by Shino.

210
00:15:10,830 --> 00:15:13,880
The problems just keep on appearing.

211
00:15:14,980 --> 00:15:16,940
Saki...

212
00:15:18,900 --> 00:15:20,770
Are you happy that I two-timed you?

213
00:15:20,770 --> 00:15:22,710
Of course not!

214
00:15:23,490 --> 00:15:25,970
Are you an idiot?

215
00:15:25,970 --> 00:15:28,700
That makes sense.

216
00:15:29,260 --> 00:15:34,160
Still, I want to ask you properly.

217
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:40,850
How do you feel about
our relationship right now?

218
00:15:40,850 --> 00:15:43,340
Are you hiding the painful feelings?

219
00:15:47,150 --> 00:15:50,760
Honestly, I'm afraid to hear your answer.

220
00:15:51,310 --> 00:15:54,720
But I want to know how you feel.

221
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:58,190
I think I have to know.

222
00:15:59,180 --> 00:16:00,600
Naoya.

223
00:16:07,490 --> 00:16:15,000
If I tell you, that I really hurt and
I'm at my limit, what will you do then?

224
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:16,500
I'll figure something out!

225
00:16:16,500 --> 00:16:17,960
Why'd you even ask then?

226
00:16:19,780 --> 00:16:22,360
Naoya, you never change.

227
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:24,670
So, what's your answer?

228
00:16:31,250 --> 00:16:33,290
Let's light these fireworks for now.

229
00:16:33,290 --> 00:16:34,050
Huh?

230
00:16:34,050 --> 00:16:35,630
Since you already bought them.

231
00:16:35,630 --> 00:16:38,310
Oh... Sure.

232
00:16:44,584 --> 00:16:47,400
This is bringing me back.

233
00:16:49,250 --> 00:16:51,880
I bet Shino said a lot of things to you.

234
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:56,620
Well, that's true.

235
00:17:00,290 --> 00:17:04,420
I do feel a bit lonely.

236
00:17:06,120 --> 00:17:12,090
You've always looked at me,
but then you met Nagisa.

237
00:17:13,350 --> 00:17:19,560
Now it's like I'll never be able to
monopolize your feelings.

238
00:17:21,440 --> 00:17:24,610
If I tell you that you have to
break up with her,

239
00:17:24,610 --> 00:17:28,560
Nagisa will still remain in your heart.

240
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:33,480
That's just a bit sad.

241
00:17:35,210 --> 00:17:36,700
However...

242
00:17:37,300 --> 00:17:40,660
Even now, I still love you.

243
00:17:42,970 --> 00:17:48,800
You're stupidly honest, a hard worker,
and bad at giving up.

244
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:50,340
I love all of that about you.

245
00:17:51,350 --> 00:17:55,800
When you asked me for permission to
two-timing, I did want to beat you.

246
00:17:58,100 --> 00:18:03,940
There's a part of mine that believes
you still wouldn't lie to me.

247
00:18:04,650 --> 00:18:08,150
Well, I obviously got quite upset
at the start.

248
00:18:11,910 --> 00:18:18,330
Honestly, I don't know what
the future holds for the three of us.

249
00:18:20,580 --> 00:18:25,540
But I'm not really worried about
the relationship between me and you.

250
00:18:27,390 --> 00:18:31,970
Because you've been telling me
that you love me all the time.

251
00:18:31,970 --> 00:18:33,880
Saki, I love you!

252
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:36,680
Since back then, again and again.

253
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:38,260
I love you, Saki!

254
00:18:38,260 --> 00:18:39,640
Like a fool.

255
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:41,720
I love you, Saki!

256
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:43,360
I love you!

257
00:18:43,360 --> 00:18:45,100
No matter how many years...

258
00:18:45,100 --> 00:18:46,600
I love you!

259
00:18:46,600 --> 00:18:48,120
...and years after that.

260
00:18:55,770 --> 00:18:57,240
That's why...

261
00:18:57,810 --> 00:19:05,210
I totally believe that
you'll always be in love with me.

262
00:19:05,570 --> 00:19:08,670
Saki...

263
00:19:08,670 --> 00:19:12,020
Perhaps that's just because
I'm just a fool as well.

264
00:19:13,770 --> 00:19:17,090
So, you don't have to worry.

265
00:19:17,550 --> 00:19:22,060
We always love each other.

266
00:19:22,630 --> 00:19:25,520
We're playing with fireworks right now.

267
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:28,520
And every day is kinda fun.

268
00:19:29,060 --> 00:19:32,480
I'm happy with how things are right now.

269
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:44,910
Regarding the two-timing, you just
have to do your best to convince me.

270
